与工作相关的死亡？

135
00:07:37,860 --> 00:07:40,200
That must be reported within eight hours.
必须在八小时内报告。

136
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:45,420
If an employee suffers an inpatient hospitalization, an amputation, or the loss of an eye,
如果员工住院治疗、截肢或失去一只眼睛，

137
00:07:45,420 --> 00:07:49,300
you have exactly 24 hours to notify them.
你只有 24 小时来通报他们。

138
00:07:49,300 --> 00:07:54,440
Because of those incredibly tight windows, your investigation has to start immediately.
由于时限如此之紧，你的调查必须立即开始。

139
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:57,060
The first few hours are absolutely critical.
最初的几个小时绝对关键。

140
00:07:57,060 --> 00:08:00,420
Just look at a massive 2023 reactor fire.
看看 2023 年那场严重的反应釜火灾。

141
00:08:00,420 --> 00:08:03,540
Investigators were on it within 30 minutes of the flames being put out.
火焰扑灭后 30 分钟内，调查人员就已到场。

142
00:08:03,540 --> 00:08:07,260
You have to preserve evidence, quarantine the equipment, and interview witnesses before
你必须保全证据、隔离设备，并在目击者记忆开始模糊

143
00:08:07,260 --> 00:08:10,300
their memories start drifting or a shift change happens.
或换班之前对他们进行问询。

144
00:08:10,300 --> 00:08:14,720
If you wait until the next day, the critical context of what went wrong is already evaporating.
如果你等到第二天，关于问题出在哪里的关键背景信息就已经在流失了。

145
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:17,980
But how we investigate matters just as much as when.
但我们如何调查，与何时调查同样重要。

146
00:08:17,980 --> 00:08:19,600
Have you ever heard of a Just Culture?
你听说过公正文化吗？

147
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:24,920
It's a framework that distinguishes between an honest error, at-risk behavior, and reckless
这是一个区分无心之失、有风险行为和鲁莽

148
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:25,920
conduct.
行为的框架。

149
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:30,000
In 2022, a really strong analyst skipped a step in an SOP under immense time pressure
2022 年，一名非常优秀的分析员在巨大的时间压力下跳过了 SOP 中的一个步骤，

150
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,560
and caused an incident.
导致了一起事故。

151
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:35,340
A traditional investigation would just blame the analyst and discipline them, but a Just
传统的调查只会指责这名分析员并给予处分，但公正

152
00:08:35,340 --> 00:08:39,300
Culture approach revealed the time pressure was systemic and the SOP was missing a vital
文化的方法揭示出，时间压力是系统性的，而且 SOP 缺少一个关键的

153
00:08:39,300 --> 00:08:40,800
verification step.
核查步骤。

154
00:08:40,800 --> 00:08:44,160
So they didn't fire the analyst, they re-engineered the SOP.
所以他们没有开除这名分析员，而是重新设计了 SOP。

155
00:08:44,160 --> 00:08:46,760
Becoming individuals just drives reporting underground.
指责个人只会让报告转入地下。

156
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:50,740
Just Culture targets the systemic roots and brings those issues out into the light.
公正文化针对的是系统性根源，并把这些问题摆到台面上来。

157
00:08:50,740 --> 00:08:55,240
And that leads us to the ultimate goal of all of this, the CAPA.
这就引出了这一切的最终目标：CAPA，

158
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:59,760
Corrective and Preventive Action Look, it's really easy to investigate an
即纠正和预防措施。你看，调查一起事故、

159
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:03,340
incident, write down a new rule, and file it away in a cabinet.
写下一条新规定、然后把它归档进柜子里，是很容易的。

160
00:09:03,340 --> 00:09:06,220
But I want to leave you with this final, provocative thought.
但我想留给你最后一个发人深省的问题。

161
00:09:06,220 --> 00:09:10,360
Is your CAPA just paperwork, or did you actually close the loop?
你的 CAPA 只是一纸文书，还是你真正形成了闭环？

162
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:14,140
Because if you didn't fundamentally change the system to prevent a recurrence, you haven't
因为如果你没有从根本上改变系统以防止事故再次发生，你就

163
00:09:14,140 --> 00:09:15,800
really learned anything.
并没有真正学到任何东西。

164
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:20,440
And when the next day inevitably arrives, it won't be the paperwork that saves your life,
而当那一天不可避免地到来时，救你性命的不会是那些文书，

165
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:23,340
it will be the real, tangible changes you made today.
而是你今天做出的真实、切实的改变。

166
00:09:23,340 --> 00:09:24,100
Stay safe out there.
注意安全。
